@startuml dataset_generation_pipeline
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam activityBorderColor #333333
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #E8F4FD
skinparam arrowColor #333333

title IQA Training Dataset Generation Pipeline
footer Dataset Version: phase7_mvp v1.0 | Seed: 42

|#LightBlue|Source Data|
start
:Source Images\n(E: drive);
note right
  16 source datasets:
  * DIQA-5000 (3,500)
  * RVL-CDIP (3,500)
  * TableBank (2,500)
  * DocLayNet (2,500)
  * PubTabNet (2,000)
  * + 11 more sources
  ----
  Total: ~1.04M available
end note

|#LightGreen|Step 1: Consolidation|
:consolidate_base_images.py;
note right
  **Parameters:**
  * Seed: 42
  * Target: 25,000 samples
  ----
  **Outputs:**
  * 00_base_images/{source}/
  * manifest.json (SHA256 hashes)
end note
:Random sample 25K images\nfrom 16 sources;
:Create symlinks to source files;
:Compute SHA256 hash (first 64KB)\nper source image;
:Generate manifest.json\nwith full lineage;

|#LightYellow|Step 2: Augmentation|
:generate_iqa_dataset.py;
note right
  **Parameters:**
  * Seed: 42
  * Resolution: 384x384
  * Resize: Lanczos
  ----
  **Defect Types:**
  * Blur (Gaussian/motion/median)
  * Noise (Gaussian/salt-pepper)
  * Compression (JPEG quality)
  * Lighting (brightness/contrast)
  * Geometric (rotation/perspective)
end note
:Resize to 384x384 (Lanczos);
:Apply synthetic degradations\n(5 defect types, 4 severity levels);
:Calculate continuous severity labels\n[0.0, 0.95] per dimension;
:Calculate DQS score\n(aggregate quality metric);
:Generate metadata.json\nwith augmentation params;

|#LightCoral|Step 3: Splitting|
:create_phase7_splits.py;
note right
  **Split Ratios:**
  * Train: 70% (17,469)
  * Val: 15% (3,719)
  * Test: 15% (3,812)
  ----
  **Stratification:**
  * By source dataset
  * Prevents leakage
end note
:Stratified split by source dataset;
:Prevent same-source leakage\nacross splits;
:Generate per-split metadata:\n* train_metadata.json\n* val_metadata.json\n* test_metadata.json;

|#Lavender|Step 4: Packaging|
:create_phase7_tar_archives.py;
note right
  **Archives Created:**
  * phase7_mvp_train.tar.gz
  * phase7_mvp_val.tar.gz
  * phase7_mvp_test.tar.gz
  ----
  **Contents per archive:**
  * images/ folder
  * {split}_metadata.json
end note
:Compress images + metadata\ninto tar.gz archives;
:Generate manifest.json\nwith archive sizes;

|#LightGray|Upload|
:Upload to GCS;
note right
  **Location:**
  gs://image_detection_b/
    datasets/phase7_mvp/
  ----
  **Total Size:** 858 MB
end note
:gs://image_detection_b/datasets/phase7_mvp/;
stop

legend right
  |= Stage |= Output Directory |
  | Consolidation | data/phase7_mvp/00_base_images/ |
  | Augmentation | data/phase7_mvp/01_augmented/ |
  | Splitting | data/phase7_mvp/02_splits/ |
  | Packaging | data/phase7_mvp/03_archives/ |
endlegend

@enduml
